## Context

The author adopted the joint three-dimension framing in
conception/jetp-short-paper-framing-2026-09-15.md. Analyse which just-transition
functions progress, who finances them, and the prior history of the same JETP
operations. Public and private finance are in scope. The earlier causal designs
remain deferred; 0816 defines this descriptive protocol and 0822 supplies inputs.
Parent programme: 0725.

## First test

A hand-calculated fixture contains two sources for one contribution, a mixed
package without a lender split, an undated milestone and a cancelled operation.
Count the contribution once, preserve unknown private amounts and dates, retain
the cancelled case, and reproduce the known counts and monetary subtotals.
The joined sample and exclusions must be explicit for all three dimensions.

## Actions

Implement the frozen 0816 protocol on the 0822 snapshot. Analyse:
A progression by transition function, B public/private contributions and
instruments, C documented pre/post-JETP operation histories.
Separate physical implementation from financial status. Retain overlapping
functions without double-counting amounts. Use ownership evidence to classify
financiers; retain unallocated mixed amounts. Compute durations only from
comparable evidenced endpoints and bounds. Report dates and partnership ages.

Report unique operation denominators, missingness by dimension, intersection of
the three samples, coverage by country, and sensitivity to scope, monetary bases,
date bounds, source changes and large operations. Do not infer a causal
acceleration, private additionality, social outcomes or verified absence from
unobserved records. Record prior inspection and protocol amendments.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] Protocol and snapshot revisions pinned before primary analysis
- [ ] Three dimensions reproduced with explicit common sample and excluded/unknown cases
- [ ] Public/private classifications, overlaps and amounts traceable to evidence
- [ ] Progression and history use event semantics, not reporting dates or fictitious clocks
- [ ] Null/mixed findings and scope/date/coverage/concentration sensitivities retained
- [ ] Run manifest, tables and plotted-data handoff ready for 0823

## Storage

Use existing canonical evidence; derived outputs are regenerable under
data/derived/jetp. Do not promote research estimates into canonical facts.

